span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:06.393" end="00:06.660">し</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:06.660" end="00:06.860">つ</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">問</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:06.860" end="00:07.040">も</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:07.040" end="00:07.200">ん</span></span></span> <span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">恋っ</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:07.200" end="00:07.382">こ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:07.382" end="00:07.600">い</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:07.600" end="00:07.720">っ</span></span></span><span begin="00:07.720" end="00:08.080">て</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">何</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:08.080" end="00:08.300">な</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:08.300" end="00:08.460">ん</span></span></span><span begin="00:08.460" end="00:08.640">で</span><span begin="00:08.640" end="00:08.820">しょ</span><span begin="00:08.820" end="00:08.960">う</span><span begin="00:08.960" end="00:09.320">か？</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">质问！ 恋爱到底是什么样的？</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">shitsumon koi tte nan deshō ka?</span></p><p begin="00:09.320" end="00:12.160" ttm:agent="v2_2" ttd:agents="v2" itunes:key="L2"><span begin="00:09.320" end="00:09.580">お</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">試</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:09.580" end="00:09.680">た</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:09.680" end="00:09.840">め</span></span></span><span begin="00:09.840" end="00:10.040">し</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">期</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:10.040" end="00:10.220">き</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">間</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:10.220" end="00:10.400">か</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:10.400" end="00:10.520">ん</span></span></span> <span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">私</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:10.520" end="00:10.920">わ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:10.920" end="00:11.100">た</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:11.100" end="00:11.280">し</span></span></span><span begin="00:11.280" end="00:11.460">は</span><span begin="00:11.460" end="00:11.600">ど</span><span begin="00:11.600" end="00:11.800">う</span><span begin="00:11.800" end="00:11.980">で</span><span begin="00:11.980" end="00:12.160">す?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">试用期，我表现的怎么样？</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">otameshi kikan watashi wa dō desu?</span></p><p begin="00:12.160" end="00:14.280" ttm:agent="v1_2" ttd:agents="v1 v2" itunes:key="L3"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">運命共同体</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:12.160" end="00:12.360">し</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:12.360" end="00:12.493">ん</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:12.493" end="00:12.650">ゆ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:12.650" end="00:12.860">う</span></span></span><span begin="00:12.860" end="00:13.060">か</span><span begin="00:13.060" end="00:13.340">ら</span><span begin="00:13.340" end="00:13.620" ttx:rubyGroup="1" ttx:rubyText="kiss" ttx:rubyTimes="00:13.340,00:13.760">キ</span><span begin="00:13.620" end="00:13.760" ttx:rubyGroup="1">ス</span><span begin="00:13.760" end="00:13.960">な</span><span begin="00:13.960" end="00:14.080">ん</span><span begin="00:14.080" end="00:14.280">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">命运共同体接个吻什么的</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">shin'yū kara kisu nante</span></p><p begin="00:14.280" end="00:14.960" ttm:agent="v1_2" ttd:agents="v2 v1" itunes:key="L4"><span begin="00:14.280" end="00:14.440">ノ</span><span begin="00:14.440" end="00:14.640">ン</span><span begin="00:14.640" end="00:14.760">ノ</span><span begin="00:14.760" end="00:14.960">ン</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">no~no~</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">non non</span></p><p begin="00:14.960" end="00:17.760" ttm:agent="v1_2" ttd:agents="v1" itunes:key="L5"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">虜</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:14.960" end="00:15.140">と</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:15.140" end="00:15.300">り</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:15.300" end="00:15.500">こ</span></span></span><span begin="00:15.500" end="00:15.700">に</span><span begin="00:15.700" end="00:15.920">な</span><span begin="00:15.920" end="00:16.020">ん</span><span begin="00:16.020" end="00:16.220">て</span><span begin="00:16.220" end="00:16.560">なっ</span><span begin="00:16.560" end="00:16.760">て</span><span begin="00:16.760" end="00:16.946">や</span><span begin="00:16.946" end="00:17.080">ん</span><span begin="00:17.080" end="00:17.300">な</span><span begin="00:17.300" end="00:17.439">い</span> <span begin="00:17.439" end="00:17.520">→</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">哀</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:17.520" end="00:17.620">あ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:17.620" end="00:17.760">い</span></span></span><span ttm:role="x-translation">才不会轻易沦陷呢→（哀怨脸）</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">toriko ni nante natte yannai ai</span></p><p begin="00:29.040" end="00:31.580" ttm:agent="v2_2" ttd:agents="v2" itunes:key="L6"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">真っ</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:29.040" end="00:29.300">ま</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:29.300" end="00:29.320">っ</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">白</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:29.320" end="00:29.800">し</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:29.800" end="00:30.151">ろ</span></span></span><span begin="00:30.151" end="00:30.340">な</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">花</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:30.340" end="00:30.700">は</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:30.700" end="00:30.840">な</span></span></span><span begin="00:30.840" end="00:31.180">そっ</span><span begin="00:31.180" end="00:31.580">と</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">纯白花朵</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">masshiro na hana sotto</span></p><p begin="00:31.900" end="00:34.380" ttm:agent="v2_2" ttd:agents="v2" itunes:key="L7"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">並</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:31.900" end="00:32.280">な</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:32.280" end="00:32.660">ら</span></span></span><span begin="00:32.660" end="00:32.980">ん</span><span begin="00:32.980" end="00:33.140">で</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">咲</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:33.140" end="00:33.500">さ</span></span></span><span begin="00:33.500" end="00:33.680">い</span><span begin="00:33.680" end="00:33.880">て</span><span begin="00:33.880" end="00:34.040">い</span><span begin="00:34.040" end="00:34.380">る</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">静静并肩绽放</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">narande saite iru</span></p><p begin="00:34.660" end="00:40.330" ttm:agent="v2_2" ttd:agents="v2" itunes:key="L8"><span begin="00:34.660" end="00:35.380">そっ</span><span begin="00:35.380" end="00:35.760">ぽ</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">向</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:35.760" end="00:35.960">む</span></span></span><span begin="00:35.960" end="00:36.300">い</span><span begin="00:36.300" end="00:36.500">て</span><span begin="00:36.500" end="00:36.840">た</span><span begin="00:36.840" end="00:37.180">り</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">見</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:37.480" end="00:37.880">み</span></span></span><span begin="00:37.880" end="00:38.260">つ</span><span begin="00:38.260" end="00:38.620">め</span><span begin="00:38.620" end="00:38.820">た</span><span begin="00:38.820" end="00:39.140">り</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="00:39.476" end="00:40.330" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="00:39.476" end="00:39.753">Keep</span> <span begin="00:39.753" end="00:39.880">close</span> <span begin="00:39.880" end="00:40.033">to</span> <span begin="00:40.033" end="00:40.330">me</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">离我再近一点嘛</span></span><span ttm:role="x-translation">偷瞄一眼又假装看远方</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">soppo muitari mitsumetari</span></p><p begin="00:40.400" end="00:45.700" ttm:agent="v1_2" ttd:agents="v1" itunes:key="L9"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">安</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:40.400" end="00:40.740">あ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:40.740" end="00:41.080">ん</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">定</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:41.080" end="00:41.440">て</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:41.440" end="00:41.620">い</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">関</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:41.620" end="00:41.940">か</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:41.940" end="00:42.140">ん</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">係</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:42.140" end="00:42.500">け</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:42.500" end="00:42.820">い</span></span></span> <span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">築</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:43.180" end="00:43.540">き</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:43.540" end="00:43.900">ず</span></span></span><span begin="00:43.900" end="00:44.240">い</span><span begin="00:44.240" end="00:44.460">て</span><span begin="00:44.460" end="00:44.780">い</span><span begin="00:44.780" end="00:44.980">た</span><span begin="00:44.980" end="00:45.300">の</span><span begin="00:45.300" end="00:45.700">に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">明明都建立好稳定关系了啦</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">antei kankei kizuite ita noni</span></p><p begin="00:46.000" end="00:50.620" ttm:agent="v1_2" ttd:agents="v1" itunes:key="L10"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">意</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:46.000" end="00:46.340">い</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">識</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:46.340" end="00:46.720">し</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:46.720" end="00:47.020">き</span></span></span><span begin="00:47.020" end="00:47.260">し</span><span begin="00:47.260" end="00:47.560">て</span><span begin="00:47.560" end="00:47.800">し</span><span begin="00:47.800" end="00:48.160">まっ</span><span begin="00:48.160" end="00:48.480">た</span> <span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">壊</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:48.820" end="00:49.200">こ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:49.200" end="00:49.520">わ</span></span></span><span begin="00:49.520" end="00:49.880">れ</span><span begin="00:49.880" end="00:50.080">ちゃ</span><span begin="00:50.080" end="00:50.620">う</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">却因突然意识到濒临崩离</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">ishiki shite shimatta kowarechau</span></p><p begin="00:51.620" end="00:54.500" ttm:agent="v2_2" ttd:agents="v2" itunes:key="L11"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">名</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:51.620" end="00:51.860">な</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">前</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:51.860" end="00:52.020">ま</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:52.020" end="00:52.220">え</span></span></span><span begin="00:52.220" end="00:52.380">で</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">呼</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:52.380" end="00:52.620">よ</span></span></span><span begin="00:52.620" end="00:52.700">ん</span><span begin="00:52.700" end="00:52.920">で</span><span begin="00:52.920" end="00:53.240">ド</span><span begin="00:53.240" end="00:53.440">キ</span><span begin="00:53.440" end="00:53.640">ド</span><span begin="00:53.640" end="00:53.780">キ</span><span begin="00:53.780" end="00:54.140">し</span><span begin="00:54.140" end="00:54.340">て</span><span begin="00:54.340" end="00:54.500">る</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">被你叫名字就心跳不已</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">namae de yonde dokidoki shiteru</span></p><p begin="00:54.506" end="00:56.980" ttm:agent="v2_2" ttd:agents="v2" itunes:key="L12"><span begin="00:54.506" end="00:54.700">バ</span><span begin="00:54.700" end="00:54.860">レ</span><span begin="00:54.860" end="00:55.040">バ</span><span begin="00:55.040" end="00:55.220">レ</span><span begin="00:55.220" end="00:55.560">こっ</span><span begin="00:55.560" end="00:55.760">ち</span><span begin="00:55.760" end="00:56.100">が</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">恥</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:56.100" end="00:56.260">は</span></span></span><span begin="00:56.260" end="00:56.600">ず</span><span begin="00:56.600" end="00:56.980">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">我这害羞样暴露无遗</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">barebare kocchi ga hazui</span></p><p begin="00:57.320" end="01:00.140" ttm:agent="v1_2" ttd:agents="v1" itunes:key="L13"><span begin="00:57.320" end="00:57.680">こっ</span><span begin="00:57.680" end="00:57.900">か</span><span begin="00:57.900" end="00:58.000">ら</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">先</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:58.000" end="00:58.200">さ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:58.200" end="00:58.380">き</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">見</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:58.380" end="00:58.560">み</span></span></span><span begin="00:58.560" end="00:58.900">た</span><span begin="00:58.900" end="00:59.100">こ</span><span begin="00:59.100" end="00:59.260">と</span><span begin="00:59.260" end="00:59.440">な</span><span begin="00:59.440" end="00:59.620">い</span><span begin="00:59.620" end="00:59.780">く</span><span begin="00:59.780" end="01:00.000">せ</span><span begin="01:00.000" end="01:00.140">に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">明明从未见过未来的发展</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">kokkara saki mita koto nai kuse ni</span></p><p begin="01:00.140" end="01:02.520" ttm:agent="v1_2" ttd:agents="v1" itunes:key="L14"><span begin="01:00.140" end="01:00.460">ねぇ?</span> <span begin="01:00.820" end="01:00.980">ま</span><span begin="01:00.980" end="01:01.220">さ</span><span begin="01:01.220" end="01:01.380">か</span><span begin="01:01.380" end="01:01.740">ビ</span><span begin="01:01.740" end="01:02.060">ビっ</span><span begin="01:02.060" end="01:02.280">て</span><span begin="01:02.280" end="01:02.520">る?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">喂喂！你不会在紧张吧！</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">nē? masaka bibitteru?</span></p><p begin="01:02.833" end="01:05.780" ttm:agent="v1_2" ttd:agents="v1 v2" itunes:key="L15"><span begin="01:02.833" end="01:03.180">そ</span><span begin="01:03.180" end="01:03.280">も</span><span begin="01:03.280" end="01:03.520">そ</span><span begin="01:03.520" end="01:03.660">も</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">恋っ</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:03.660" end="01:03.880">こ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:03.880" end="01:04.100">い</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:04.100" end="01:04.200">っ</span></span></span><span begin="01:04.200" end="01:04.560">て</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">何</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:04.560" end="01:04.800">な</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:04.800" end="01:04.920">ん</span></span></span><span begin="01:04.920" end="01:05.080">で</span><span begin="01:05.080" end="01:05.300">しょ</span><span begin="01:05.300" end="01:05.440">う</span><span begin="01:05.440" end="01:05.780">か?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">所以恋爱到底是什么样的？</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">somosomo koi tte nan deshō ka?</span></p><p begin="01:05.780" end="01:08.620" ttm:agent="v2_2" ttd:agents="v2" itunes:key="L16"><span begin="01:05.780" end="01:05.973">お</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">試</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:05.973" end="01:06.160">た</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:06.160" end="01:06.280">め</span></span></span><span begin="01:06.280" end="01:06.480">し</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">期</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:06.480" end="01:06.680">き</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">間</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:06.680" end="01:06.880">か</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:06.880" end="01:07.000">ん</span></span></span> <span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">私</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:07.000" end="01:07.400">わ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:07.400" end="01:07.540">た</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:07.540" end="01:07.740">し</span></span></span><span begin="01:07.740" end="01:07.920">は</span><span begin="01:07.920" end="01:08.060">ど</span><span begin="01:08.060" end="01:08.280">う</span><span begin="01:08.280" end="01:08.440">で</span><span begin="01:08.440" end="01:08.620">す?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">试用期，我表现的怎么样？</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">otameshi kikan watashi wa dō desu?</span></p><p begin="01:08.620" end="01:10.760" ttm:agent="v1_2" ttd:agents="v1 v2" itunes:key="L17"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">運命共同体</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:08.620" end="01:08.820">し</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:08.820" end="01:08.940">ん</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:08.940" end="01:09.130">ゆ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:09.130" end="01:09.320">う</span></span></span><span begin="01:09.320" end="01:09.500">か</span><span begin="01:09.500" end="01:09.820">ら</span><span begin="01:09.820" end="01:10.093" ttx:rubyGroup="1" ttx:rubyText="kiss" ttx:rubyTimes="01:09.820,01:10.220">キ</span><span begin="01:10.093" end="01:10.220" ttx:rubyGroup="1">ス</span><span begin="01:10.220" end="01:10.420">な</span><span begin="01:10.420" end="01:10.560">ん</span><span begin="01:10.560" end="01:10.760">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">命运共同体接个吻什么的</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">shin'yū kara kisu nante</span></p><p begin="01:10.760" end="01:11.420" ttm:agent="v1_2" ttd:agents="v1 v2" itunes:key="L18"><span begin="01:10.760" end="01:10.900">ノ</span><span begin="01:10.900" end="01:11.120">ン</span><span begin="01:11.120" end="01:11.220">ノ</span><span begin="01:11.220" end="01:11.420">ン</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">no~no~</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">non non</span></p><p begin="01:11.420" end="01:14.240" ttm:agent="v1_2" ttd:agents="v1" itunes:key="L19"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">虜</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:11.420" end="01:11.600">と</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:11.600" end="01:11.800">り</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:11.800" end="01:11.960">こ</span></span></span><span begin="01:11.960" end="01:12.160">に</span><span begin="01:12.160" end="01:12.380">な</span><span begin="01:12.380" end="01:12.520">ん</span><span begin="01:12.520" end="01:12.680">て</span><span begin="01:12.680" end="01:13.020">なっ</span><span begin="01:13.020" end="01:13.220">て</span><span begin="01:13.220" end="01:13.410">や</span><span begin="01:13.410" end="01:13.565">ん</span><span begin="01:13.565" end="01:13.760">な</span><span begin="01:13.760" end="01:13.899">い</span> <span begin="01:13.899" end="01:13.980">→</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">哀</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:13.980" end="01:14.100">あ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:14.100" end="01:14.240">い</span></span></span><span ttm:role="x-translation">才不会轻易沦陷呢→（哀怨脸）</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">toriko ni nante natte yannai ai</span></p><p begin="01:25.540" end="01:30.800" ttm:agent="v1_2" ttd:agents="v1" itunes:key="L20"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">高</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:25.540" end="01:25.909">た</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:25.909" end="01:26.240">か</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">嶺</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:26.240" end="01:26.600">ね</span></span></span><span begin="01:26.600" end="01:26.800">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">花</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:26.800" end="01:27.140">は</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:27.140" end="01:27.340">な</span></span></span><span begin="01:27.340" end="01:27.680">と</span><span begin="01:27.680" end="01:27.960">か</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">不</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:28.312" end="01:28.653">ふ</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">釣</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:28.653" end="01:29.080">つ</span></span></span><span begin="01:29.080" end="01:29.420">り</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">合</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:29.420" end="01:29.620">あ</span></span></span><span begin="01:29.620" end="01:29.920">い</span><span begin="01:29.920" end="01:30.140">だ</span><span begin="01:30.140" end="01:30.500">と</span><span begin="01:30.500" end="01:30.800">か</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">高岭之花什么的 不般配什么的</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">takane no hana toka futsuriai da toka</span></p><p begin="01:31.160" end="01:35.760" ttm:agent="v2_2" ttd:agents="v2" itunes:key="L21"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">決</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:31.160" end="01:31.567">き</span></span></span><span begin="01:31.567" end="01:31.920">め</span><span begin="01:31.920" end="01:32.218">る</span><span begin="01:32.218" end="01:32.440">の</span><span begin="01:32.440" end="01:32.800">は</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">私</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:32.800" end="01:32.980">わ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:32.980" end="01:33.183">た</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:33.183" end="01:33.640">し</span></span></span> <span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">進</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:33.933" end="01:34.220">す</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:34.220" end="01:34.631">す</span></span></span><span begin="01:34.631" end="01:35.060">ん</span><span begin="01:35.060" end="01:35.260">じゃ</span><span begin="01:35.260" end="01:35.760">え</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">决定权在我这里！ 继续前进！</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">kimeru no wa watashi susunjae</span></p><p begin="01:36.820" end="01:39.680" ttm:agent="v1_2" ttd:agents="v1" itunes:key="L22"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">偶</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:36.820" end="01:37.000">ぐ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:37.000" end="01:37.180">う</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">然</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:37.180" end="01:37.360">ぜ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:37.360" end="01:37.540">ん</span></span></span><span begin="01:37.540" end="01:37.740" ttx:rubyGroup="1" ttx:rubyText="plus" ttx:rubyTimes="01:37.540,01:38.080">プ</span><span begin="01:37.740" end="01:37.880" ttx:rubyGroup="1">ラ</span><span begin="01:37.880" end="01:38.080" ttx:rubyGroup="1">ス</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">運</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:38.080" end="01:38.290">う</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:38.290" end="01:38.440">ん</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">命</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:38.440" end="01:38.620">め</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:38.620" end="01:38.800">い</span></span></span><span begin="01:38.800" end="01:38.960">を</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">少</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:38.960" end="01:39.130">しょ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:39.130" end="01:39.300">う</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">々</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:39.300" end="01:39.490">しょ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:39.490" end="01:39.680">う</span></span></span><span ttm:role="x-translation">偶然叠加少许命运安排</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">gūzen purasu unmei o shōshō</span></p><p begin="01:39.680" end="01:42.160" ttm:agent="v1_2" ttd:agents="v1" itunes:key="L23"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">不</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:39.680" end="01:39.860">ふ</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">可</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:39.860" end="01:40.000">か</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">抗</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:40.000" end="01:40.240">こ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:40.240" end="01:40.400">う</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">力</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:40.400" end="01:40.520">りょ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:40.520" end="01:40.728">く</span></span></span><span begin="01:40.728" end="01:40.880">な</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">接</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:40.880" end="01:41.258">せ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:41.258" end="01:41.446">っ</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">近</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:41.446" end="01:41.540">き</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:41.540" end="01:41.780">ん</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">戦</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:41.780" end="01:41.960">せ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:41.960" end="01:42.160">ん</span></span></span><span ttm:role="x-translation">无法抗拒的近距离战</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">fukakōryoku na sekkin sen</span></p><p begin="01:42.480" end="01:45.328" ttm:agent="v2_2" ttd:agents="v2" itunes:key="L24"><span begin="01:42.480" end="01:42.840">こっ</span><span begin="01:42.840" end="01:43.040">か</span><span begin="01:43.040" end="01:43.180">ら</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">先</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:43.180" end="01:43.400">さ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:43.400" end="01:43.540">き</span></span></span><span begin="01:43.540" end="01:43.740">し</span><span begin="01:43.740" end="01:44.080">た</span><span begin="01:44.080" end="01:44.260">こ</span><span begin="01:44.260" end="01:44.440">と</span><span begin="01:44.440" end="01:44.620">な</span><span begin="01:44.620" end="01:44.796">い</span><span begin="01:44.796" end="01:44.962">く</span><span begin="01:44.962" end="01:45.160">せ</span><span begin="01:45.160" end="01:45.328">に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">明明接下来都没有经历过</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">kokkara saki shita koto nai kuse ni</span></p><p begin="01:45.328" end="01:47.720" ttm:agent="v2_2" ttd:agents="v2" itunes:key="L25"><span begin="01:45.328" end="01:45.636">ねぇ?</span> <span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">君</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:45.979" end="01:46.240">き</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:46.240" end="01:46.560">み</span></span></span> <span begin="01:46.560" end="01:46.980">ビ</span><span begin="01:46.980" end="01:47.180">ビっ</span><span begin="01:47.180" end="01:47.440">て</span><span begin="01:47.440" end="01:47.720">る?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">喂喂！你不会在紧张吧？</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">nē? kimi bibitteru?</span></p><p begin="01:48.033" end="01:50.980" ttm:agent="v1_2" ttd:agents="v1 v2" itunes:key="L26"><span begin="01:48.033" end="01:48.270">そ</span><span begin="01:48.270" end="01:48.433">も</span><span begin="01:48.433" end="01:48.700">そ</span><span begin="01:48.700" end="01:48.860">も</span><span begin="01:48.860" end="01:49.040">こ</span><span begin="01:49.040" end="01:49.381">れっ</span><span begin="01:49.381" end="01:49.720">て</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">恋</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:49.720" end="01:49.920">こ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:49.920" end="01:50.100">い</span></span></span><span begin="01:50.100" end="01:50.240">で</span><span begin="01:50.240" end="01:50.460">しょ</span><span begin="01:50.460" end="01:50.620">う</span><span begin="01:50.620" end="01:50.980">か?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">所以这就是恋爱吗？</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">somosomo kore tte koi deshō ka?</span></p><p begin="01:50.980" end="01:53.807" ttm:agent="v1_2" ttd:agents="v1" itunes:key="L27"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">悪</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:50.980" end="01:51.160">わ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:51.160" end="01:51.320">る</span></span></span><span begin="01:51.320" end="01:51.495">い</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">子</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:51.495" end="01:51.640">こ</span></span></span><span begin="01:51.640" end="01:51.860">し</span><span begin="01:51.860" end="01:52.060">ちゃ</span><span begin="01:52.060" end="01:52.200">う</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">私</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:52.200" end="01:52.560">わ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:52.560" end="01:52.680">た</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:52.680" end="01:52.920">し</span></span></span><span begin="01:52.920" end="01:53.080">は</span><span begin="01:53.080" end="01:53.220">ど</span><span begin="01:53.220" end="01:53.440">う</span><span begin="01:53.440" end="01:53.600">で</span><span begin="01:53.600" end="01:53.807">す?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">变成坏孩子的我怎么样的呢？</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">warui ko shichau watashi wa dō desu?</span></p><p begin="01:53.807" end="01:56.601" ttm:agent="v1_2" ttd:agents="v1 v2" itunes:key="L28"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">不</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:53.807" end="01:53.980">ふ</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">意</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:53.980" end="01:54.142">い</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">打</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:54.142" end="01:54.300">う</span></span></span><span begin="01:54.300" end="01:54.500">ち</span><span begin="01:54.500" end="01:54.700">か</span><span begin="01:54.700" end="01:55.000">ら</span><span begin="01:55.000" end="01:55.230" ttx:rubyGroup="1" ttx:rubyText="kiss" ttx:rubyTimes="01:55.000,01:55.360">キ</span><span begin="01:55.230" end="01:55.360" ttx:rubyGroup="1">ス</span><span begin="01:55.360" end="01:55.570">な</span><span begin="01:55.570" end="01:55.729">ん</span><span begin="01:55.729" end="01:55.920">て</span><span begin="01:55.920" end="01:56.120">ノ</span><span begin="01:56.120" end="01:56.266">ン</span><span begin="01:56.266" end="01:56.440">ノ</span><span begin="01:56.440" end="01:56.601">ン</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">突袭式接吻什么的 no~no~</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">fuiuchi kara kisu nante non non</span></p><p begin="01:56.601" end="01:59.430" ttm:agent="v2_2" ttd:agents="v2" itunes:key="L29"><span begin="01:56.601" end="01:56.820">こ</span><span begin="01:56.820" end="01:57.000">れ</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">以</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:57.000" end="01:57.160">い</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">上</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:57.160" end="01:57.340">じょ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:57.340" end="01:57.636">う</span></span></span><span begin="01:57.636" end="01:57.858">ハ</span><span begin="01:57.858" end="01:58.200">マ</span><span begin="01:58.200" end="01:58.380">り</span><span begin="01:58.380" end="01:58.580">た</span><span begin="01:58.580" end="01:58.720">く</span><span begin="01:58.720" end="01:58.940">な</span><span begin="01:58.940" end="01:59.037">い</span> <span begin="01:59.037" end="01:59.160">→</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">哀</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:59.160" end="01:59.280">あ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="01:59.280" end="01:59.430">い</span></span></span><span ttm:role="x-translation">再沉迷下去就完蛋了→（哀怨脸）</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">kore ijō hamaritaku nai ai</span></p><p begin="02:10.700" end="02:14.340" ttm:agent="v2_2" ttd:agents="v2" itunes:key="L30"><span begin="02:10.700" end="02:10.810" ttx:rubyGroup="1" ttx:rubyText="question" ttx:rubyTimes="02:10.700,02:11.417">ク</span><span begin="02:10.810" end="02:10.953" ttx:rubyGroup="1">エ</span><span begin="02:10.953" end="02:11.080" ttx:rubyGroup="1">ス</span><span begin="02:11.080" end="02:11.260" ttx:rubyGroup="1">チョ</span><span begin="02:11.260" end="02:11.417" ttx:rubyGroup="1">ン</span> <span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">恋っ</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="02:11.417" end="02:11.632">こ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="02:11.632" end="02:11.840">い</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="02:11.840" end="02:11.980">っ</span></span></span><span begin="02:11.980" end="02:12.320">て</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">何</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="02:12.320" end="02:12.540">な</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="02:12.540" end="02:12.687">ん</span></span></span><span begin="02:12.687" end="02:12.793">で</span><span begin="02:12.793" end="02:13.240">しょ</span><span begin="02:13.240" end="02:13.560">う</span><span begin="02:13.560" end="02:14.340">か?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">提问恋爱到底是什么样子的？</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">kuesuchon koi tte nan deshō ka?</span></p><p begin="02:16.320" end="02:19.900" ttm:agent="v1_2" ttd:agents="v1" itunes:key="L31"><span begin="02:16.320" end="02:16.520" ttx:rubyGroup="1" ttx:rubyText="question" ttx:rubyTimes="02:16.320,02:17.060">ク</span><span begin="02:16.520" end="02:16.620" ttx:rubyGroup="1">エ</span><span begin="02:16.620" end="02:16.700" ttx:rubyGroup="1">ス</span><span begin="02:16.700" end="02:16.940" ttx:rubyGroup="1">チョ</span><span begin="02:16.940" end="02:17.060" ttx:rubyGroup="1">ン</span> <span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">恋っ</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="02:17.060" end="02:17.216">こ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="02:17.216" end="02:17.480">い</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="02:17.480" end="02:17.620">っ</span></span></span><span begin="02:17.620" end="02:17.960">て</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">何</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="02:17.960" end="02:18.180">な</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="02:18.180" end="02:18.320">ん</span></span></span><span begin="02:18.320" end="02:18.423">で</span><span begin="02:18.423" end="02:18.860">しょ</span><span begin="02:18.860" end="02:19.220">う</span><span begin="02:19.220" end="02:19.900">か?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">提问 恋爱到底是什么样子的？</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">kuesuchon koi tte nan deshō ka?</span></p><p begin="02:20.303" end="02:21.580" ttm:agent="v1_2" ttd:agents="v1 v2" itunes:key="L32"><span begin="02:20.303" end="02:20.800">せー</span><span begin="02:20.800" end="02:20.980">の</span><span begin="02:20.980" end="02:21.153" ttx:rubyGroup="1" ttx:rubyText="last" ttx:rubyTimes="02:20.980,02:21.580">ラ</span><span begin="02:21.153" end="02:21.320" ttx:rubyGroup="1">ス</span><span begin="02:21.320" end="02:21.580" ttx:rubyGroup="1">ト</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">三二一 Last!</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">sē no rasuto</span></p><p begin="02:21.903" end="02:24.840" ttm:agent="v1_2" ttd:agents="v1 v2" itunes:key="L33"><span begin="02:21.903" end="02:22.160">そ</span><span begin="02:22.160" end="02:22.313">も</span><span begin="02:22.313" end="02:22.530">そ</span><span begin="02:22.530" end="02:22.720">も</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">恋っ</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="02:22.720" end="02:22.920">こ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="02:22.920" end="02:23.140">い</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="02:23.140" end="02:23.260">っ</span></span></span><span begin="02:23.260" end="02:23.620">て</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">何</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="02:23.620" end="02:23.840">な</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="02:23.840" end="02:23.980">ん</span></span></span><span begin="02:23.980" end="02:24.120">で</span><span begin="02:24.120" end="02:24.340">しょ</span><span begin="02:24.340" end="02:24.500">う</span><span begin="02:24.500" end="02:24.840">か?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">所以恋爱到底是什么样子的？</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">somosomo koi tte nan deshō ka?</span></p><p begin="02:24.840" end="02:27.680" ttm:agent="v2_2" ttd:agents="v2" itunes:key="L34"><span begin="02:24.840" end="02:25.040">お</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">試</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="02:25.040" end="02:25.220">た</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="02:25.220" end="02:25.360">め</span></span></span><span begin="02:25.360" end="02:25.560">し</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">期</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="02:25.560" end="02:25.760">き</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">間</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="02:25.760" end="02:25.940">か</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="02:25.940" end="02:26.060">ん</span></span></span> <span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">私</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="02:26.060" end="02:26.447">わ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="02:26.447" end="02:26.632">た</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="02:26.632" end="02:26.800">し</span></span></span><span begin="02:26.800" end="02:26.960">は</span><span begin="02:26.960" end="02:27.060">ど</span><span begin="02:27.060" end="02:27.360">う</span><span begin="02:27.360" end="02:27.500">で</span><span begin="02:27.500" end="02:27.680">す?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">试用期 我表现的怎么样</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">otameshi kikan watashi wa dō desu?</span></p><p begin="02:27.680" end="02:29.802" ttm:agent="v1_2" ttd:agents="v1 v2" itunes:key="L35"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">運命共同体</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="02:27.680" end="02:27.840">し</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="02:27.840" end="02:28.000">ん</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="02:28.000" end="02:28.190">ゆ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="02:28.190" end="02:28.380">う</span></span></span><span begin="02:28.380" end="02:28.580">か</span><span begin="02:28.580" end="02:28.880">ら</span><span begin="02:28.880" end="02:29.160" ttx:rubyGroup="1" ttx:rubyText="kiss" ttx:rubyTimes="02:28.880,02:29.280">キ</span><span begin="02:29.160" end="02:29.280" ttx:rubyGroup="1">ス</span><span begin="02:29.280" end="02:29.500">な</span><span begin="02:29.500" end="02:29.640">ん</span><span begin="02:29.640" end="02:29.802">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">命运共同体接个吻什么的</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">shin'yū kara kisu nante</span></p><p begin="02:29.802" end="02:30.480" ttm:agent="v1_2" ttd:agents="v1 v2" itunes:key="L36"><span begin="02:29.802" end="02:30.030">ノ</span><span begin="02:30.030" end="02:30.146">ン</span><span begin="02:30.146" end="02:30.330">ノ</span><span begin="02:30.330" end="02:30.480">ン</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">no~no~</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">non non</span></p><p begin="02:30.480" end="02:33.273" ttm:agent="v1_2" ttd:agents="v1" itunes:key="L37"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">虜</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="02:30.480" end="02:30.660">と</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="02:30.660" end="02:30.840">り</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="02:30.840" end="02:31.020">こ</span></span></span><span begin="02:31.020" end="02:31.220">に</span><span begin="02:31.220" end="02:31.440">な</span><span begin="02:31.440" end="02:31.580">ん</span><span begin="02:31.580" end="02:31.740">て</span><span begin="02:31.740" end="02:32.080">なっ</span><span begin="02:32.080" end="02:32.260">て</span><span begin="02:32.260" end="02:32.500">や</span><span begin="02:32.500" end="02:32.620">ん</span><span begin="02:32.620" end="02:32.820">な</span><span begin="02:32.820" end="02:32.960">い</span> <span begin="02:32.960" end="02:33.040">→</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">哀</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="02:33.040" end="02:33.140">あ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="02:33.140" end="02:33.273">い</span></span></span><span ttm:role="x-translation">才不会轻易沦陷呢→（哀怨脸）</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">toriko ni nante natte yannai ai</span></p><p begin="02:33.280" end="02:36.140" ttm:agent="v2_2" ttd:agents="v2" itunes:key="L38"><span begin="02:33.280" end="02:33.540">そ</span><span begin="02:33.540" end="02:33.640">ろ</span><span begin="02:33.640" end="02:33.880">そ</span><span begin="02:33.880" end="02:34.040">ろ</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">答</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="02:34.040" end="02:34.220">こ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="02:34.220" end="02:34.540">た</span></span></span><span begin="02:34.540" end="02:34.900">え</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">聞</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="02:34.900" end="02:35.100">き</span></span></span><span begin="02:35.100" end="02:35.267">い</span><span begin="02:35.267" end="02:35.440">て</span><span begin="02:35.440" end="02:35.800">い</span><span begin="02:35.800" end="02:36.140">い?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">差不多该给个答案了吧？</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">sorosoro kotae kiite ii?</span></p><p begin="02:36.140" end="02:38.960" ttm:agent="v1_2" ttd:agents="v1" itunes:key="L39"><span begin="02:36.140" end="02:36.280">ど</span><span begin="02:36.280" end="02:36.440">う</span><span begin="02:36.440" end="02:36.720">す</span><span begin="02:36.720" end="02:36.820">る</span><span begin="02:36.820" end="02:37.040">つ</span><span begin="02:37.040" end="02:37.360">も</span><span begin="02:37.360" end="02:37.680">り?</span> <span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">触</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="02:37.680" end="02:37.900">ふ</span></span></span><span begin="02:37.900" end="02:38.080">れ</span><span begin="02:38.080" end="02:38.280">て</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">限界突破</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="02:38.280" end="02:38.960">red</span></span></span><span ttm:role="x-translation">你是怎么样打算的？触碰临界点的瞬间</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">dō suru tsumori? furete reddo</span></p><p begin="02:38.960" end="02:41.097" ttm:agent="v1_2" ttd:agents="v1 v2" itunes:key="L40"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">運命共同体</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="02:38.960" end="02:39.120">し</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="02:39.120" end="02:39.300">ん</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="02:39.300" end="02:39.490">ゆ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="02:39.490" end="02:39.680">う</span></span></span><span begin="02:39.680" end="02:39.880">か</span><span begin="02:39.880" end="02:40.180">ら</span><span begin="02:40.180" end="02:40.420" ttx:rubyGroup="1" ttx:rubyText="kiss" ttx:rubyTimes="02:40.180,02:40.540">キ</span><span begin="02:40.420" end="02:40.540" ttx:rubyGroup="1">ス</span><span begin="02:40.540" end="02:40.780">な</span><span begin="02:40.780" end="02:40.920">ん</span><span begin="02:40.920" end="02:41.097">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">命运共同体接个吻什么的</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">shin'yū kara kisu nante</span></p><p begin="02:41.097" end="02:41.780" ttm:agent="v1_2" ttd:agents="v1 v2" itunes:key="L41"><span begin="02:41.097" end="02:41.280">ノ</span><span begin="02:41.280" end="02:41.441">ン</span><span begin="02:41.441" end="02:41.640">ノ</span><span begin="02:41.640" end="02:41.780">ン</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">no~no~</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">non non</span></p><p begin="02:41.780" end="02:44.612" ttm:agent="v2_2" ttd:agents="v2" itunes:key="L42"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">虜</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="02:41.780" end="02:41.980">と</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="02:41.980" end="02:42.120">り</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="02:42.120" end="02:42.320">こ</span></span></span><span begin="02:42.320" end="02:42.520">に</span><span begin="02:42.520" end="02:42.720">な</span><span begin="02:42.720" end="02:42.880">ん</span><span begin="02:42.880" end="02:43.040">て</span><span begin="02:43.040" end="02:43.380">なっ</span><span begin="02:43.380" end="02:43.580">て</span><span begin="02:43.580" end="02:43.780">や</span><span begin="02:43.780" end="02:43.880">ん</span><span begin="02:43.880" end="02:44.140">な</span><span begin="02:44.140" end="02:44.247">い</span> <span begin="02:44.247" end="02:44.360">→</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">哀</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="02:44.360" end="02:44.470">あ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="02:44.470" end="02:44.612">い</span></span></span><span ttm:role="x-translation">才不会轻易沦陷呢 →（哀怨脸）</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">toriko ni nante natte yannai ai</span></p><p begin="02:44.610" end="02:47.420" ttm:agent="v1_2" ttd:agents="v1" itunes:key="L43"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">虜</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="02:44.610" end="02:44.830">と</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="02:44.830" end="02:44.990">り</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="02:44.990" end="02:45.157">こ</span></span></span><span begin="02:45.157" end="02:45.340">に</span><span begin="02:45.340" end="02:45.643">なっ</span><span begin="02:45.643" end="02:45.848">ちゃ</span><span begin="02:45.848" end="02:46.200">え</span><span begin="02:46.200" end="02:46.390">ば</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">案</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="02:46.390" end="02:46.580">あ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="02:46.580" end="02:46.740">ん</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">外</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="02:46.740" end="02:46.940">が</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="02:46.940" end="02:47.039">い</span></span></span> <span begin="02:47.039" end="02:47.110">→</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">愛?</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="02:47.110" end="02:47.280">あ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="02:47.280" end="02:47.420">い</span></span></span><span ttm:role="x-translation">如果意外陷入其中了呢 → 爱！？</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">toriko ni nacchaeba angai ai?</span></p></div></body></tt>